  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 28, 2026 at 07:49 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: Package rates under <a href=\"/tag/centrally+sponsored+health+insurance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">centrally sponsored health insurance</a> schemes need to be reviewed periodically to reflect rising treatment costs, said Ashutosh Raghuvanshi, Managing Director and CEO, <a href=\"/tag/fortis+healthcare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fortis Healthcare</a>.Speaking at the 20th edition of FICCI Heal 2026, Raghuvanshi said, “Central Government Health Scheme and <a href=\"/tag/pmjay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PMJAY</a> package rates, need a periodic review to reflect the changes in treatment costs, medical technology, and the requirements of quality care. Timely settlement of hospital claims is equally important. A predictable reimbursement framework will encourage greater private sector participation in support of the delivery of quality services as well as creating newer, much-needed infrastructure.”</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>This comes a year after the Union health ministry revised rates for nearly 2,000 procedures under the Central Government Health Scheme in October 2025, the first major revamp since 2014.At the time, private hospitals body, Nathealth welcomed the move while also urging that rates under government-sponsored schemes be benchmarked periodically to the Consumer Price Index.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Meanwhile, major listed hospital chains such as Fortis Healthcare, Max Healthcare and Apollo Hospitals do not participate in the Ayushman Bharat scheme, with the industry maintaining that '<a href=\"/tag/reimbursement+rates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">reimbursement rates</a> need to be viable for corporate hospitals which are based in urban localities to join the programme.' </p><p>Raghuvanshi also asked the government to rationalise the tax framework for hospitals. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>He said, “While healthcare services are GST exempt, hospitals are generally unable to claim input tax credit on input used for exempt services. This creates embedded costs and affects investment capacity. A review of the framework would help reduce these cost pressures while supporting affordable care.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 28, 2026 at 07:49 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 28, 2026 at 07:49 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href